#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/parts.rst:5
msgid "Parts panel"
msgstr "部件面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/parts.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Parts panel lists all `parts`_ (`lines`_, `terminals`_, `rectangles`_, "
"`dynamic texts`_, etc.) which make up the `element`_."
msgstr ""
"部件面板列出了组成 `元件 <element_>`_ 的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_，包括 `线条 <lines_>`_、"
"`终端 <terminals_>`_、`矩形 <rectangles_>`_、`动态文本 <dynamic texts_>`_ 等。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/parts.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Parts panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器部件面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/parts.rst:15
msgid "To display the Parts panel"
msgstr "显示部件面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/parts.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Parts** menu item to display the Parts panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 菜单项以显示部件面板。"
